  data: {
    LLM: "Pay attention to the top card of the play pile. React quickly to matching cards. Manage your money cards wisely - don't use high-value cards to buy small numbers of cards.\n\nTrack which cards have been played to predict what might come up. Time your buying to get the best value from your money cards. Force your opponent to use their high-value money cards early.\n\nCard counting is possible with practice. Optimize your money exchanges to preserve valuable cards. Use the speed factor to your advantage - play quickly when you know a match is unlikely.",
    Player: "Pay attention to the top card of the play pile. React quickly to matching cards. Manage your money cards wisely - don't use high-value cards to buy small numbers of cards.\n\nTrack which cards have been played to predict what might come up. Time your buying to get the best value from your money cards. Force your opponent to use their high-value money cards early.\n\nCard counting is possible with practice. Optimize your money exchanges to preserve valuable cards. Use the speed factor to your advantage - play quickly when you know a match is unlikely.",
